&lt;li&gt;Lead supply chain integration planning during M&amp;amp;As&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supplier Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Corporate Development to negotiate strategic partnerships with key suppliers to enhance supply chain resilience and innovation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;New Product Development&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate efforts to align supply chain capabilities with new product introduction, ensuring readiness for market launch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Risk Assessment&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Corporate Development to conduct joint risk assessments to evaluate geopolitical and supply chain risks related to:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;New market or partnerships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mid/long-term Divisions scaling constraints&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supplier sole sourcing&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sub-tier supplier constraints&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
