&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;General&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to communicate well, strong conviction in the Government&#39;s mission and good user management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced in running major projects with strong management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can think of the big picture while being able to deep-dive into details if required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to hands-on and go onsite e.g. project sites if required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive business outcomes by taking on a product from end (problem definition) to end (release and continuous improvement)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interview stakeholders and users to understand problem space and define problem statement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Craft proposals to justify resource allocations and secure funding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define success measures and set up dashboards to monitor progress.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify hypotheses, develop product strategy, and devise initiatives to drive product outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create product roadmap and work with team to ensure timely achievement of goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with designers, software engineers to develop, test and release product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measure outcomes and continuously iterate product to drive outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage with and support users to drive product adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GIS / Spatial Skillsets&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
