&lt;li&gt;Translates user needs into requirements for data pipelines, metadata, quality controls, and map-based visualization features; aligns stakeholders across GIS, data, and UX teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to ensure deliverables support planning, analytics, and decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
